{"step_index":211,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T20:53:53Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Comprehensive walkthrough of SmartAGENT and the Fluxnat Coder 3B fine-tuning suite. Includes Google Colab execution guide, training commands, local scanner usage, verification results, and architecture details.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# 🛡️ SmartAGENT & Fluxnat Coder 3B — Walkthrough\\n\\nWe have built the complete end-to-end **SmartAGENT Vulnerability Scanner** and the specialized **Fluxnat Coder 3B** fine-tuning & rebranding pipeline.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📦 What Was Built\\n\\n### 1. The Fine-Tuning & Rebranding Suite (`fluxnat/Fluxnat-Coder-3B`)\\n- [x] **[Fluxnat_Coder_3B_Training.ipynb](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/Fluxnat_Coder_3B_Training.ipynb)**: Complete 1-Click Google Colab training notebook powered by **Unsloth (2x faster, 70% less VRAM)** on a free **Tesla T4 GPU (16GB VRAM)**.\\n- [x] **[prepare_datasets.py](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/prepare_datasets.py)**: Ingestion & formatting pipeline for CyberSecurity-1M, CTI, and local Chain-of-Thought reasoning datasets.\\n- [x] **[data/custom_cot/security_cot.jsonl](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/data/custom_cot/security_cot.jsonl)**: Curated step-by-step reasoning samples teaching the model data flow tracking, CWE classification, and secure remediation.\\n- [x] **[train.py](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/train.py)**: Fine-tuning script with QLoRA ($r=64$, $\\\\alpha=128$, targeting all linear projection layers). Supports both Unsloth and standard Hugging Face PEFT/TRL.\\n- [x] **[rebrand.py](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/rebrand.py)**: Deep rebranding engine updating `config.json`, `tokenizer_config.json`, `generation_config.json`, and official Hugging Face Model Card.\\n- [x] **[merge_and_export.py](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/merge_and_export.py)**: Merges LoRA adapters into a standalone 16-bit model, exports GGUF (Q4_K_M/Q8_0), and pushes to `fluxnat/Fluxnat-Coder-3B`.\\n- [x] **[evaluate.py](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/evaluate.py)**: Benchmark test suite comparing detection on vulnerable test cases vs benign code.\\n\\n### 2. The SmartAGENT Vulnerability Scanner (`smartagent/`)\\n- [x] **[smartagent/cli.py](file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Deskto\n<truncated 3829 bytes>","Description":"\"Comprehensive walkthrough for SmartAGENT and Fluxnat Coder 3B\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\k4ran\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\e2c1cf9f-2dff-4bf4-a974-ef410441acfa\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating walkthrough\"","toolSummary":"\"Create walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
